<title>FRANCE: EU cuts flour export refund to five Ecus.</title>
<headline>EU cuts flour export refund to five Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday cut its main wheat flour export refund to five Ecus per tonne from a previous level of eight Ecus per tonne, a European grain official said .</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
